<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Protected Reports - Q3 Redis</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
    body { background: #f4f7f6; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    nav { background: #c0392b; color: white; padding: 15px 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 20px; font-weight: 500; }
    nav a.logout { background: #7f8c8d; padding: 6px 15px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .badge { background: #27ae60; color: white; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; }
    .report-card { background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: 8px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;">Q3: Redis Session Store App</div>
    <div>
      <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/reports">Reports & Analytics</a>
      <a href="/logout" class="logout">Logout</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container">
    <h2>Protected Route 2: System Reports <span class="badge">Session Valid</span></h2>
    <p>Logged in as: <strong><%= user.name %></strong> (<%= user.email %>)</p>

    <div class="report-card">
      <h4>📊 Performance & Redis Status Report</h4>
      <p>Active Session Engine: <code><%= storeType %></code></p>
      <p>TTL Expiry: 3600 Seconds (Auto Invalidation on Expiry or Logout)</p>
      <p>Data Integrity: High Speed Key-Value Store</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 25px;">
      <a href="/dashboard">&larr; Back to Dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
